flightgear-data-installer, for Sparky Stereo OS.

Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's (Capitain Jack) edition of SparkyLinux (https://sparkylinux.org, by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski).

Upstream Author(s):
    Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>

Files: * (the installer and its messages)
    Copyright (C) 2026 Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack)
    License: GPL-3+

Not in this package: FlightGear's data. It is fetched at installation from FlightGear's own release page
(https://sourceforge.net/projects/flightgear/files/release-2024.1/) and stays under the licences its own files and
documentation name. This package does not redistribute it, and the edition's repository never carries it.
Their packaging pattern: Debian's game-data-packager and ttf-mscorefonts-installer, which fetch what the
distribution may not host and check it before use.

